  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-6)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="166.4" textLength="671" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-6)">ear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-6)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-6)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-7)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="190.8" textLength="231.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-7)">&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-7)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-7)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-8)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="215.2" textLength="573.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-8)">&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-8)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-8)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-9)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="239.6" textLength="756.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-9)">nd&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-9)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-9)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-10)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="264" textLength="48.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-10)">ath.</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-10)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-10)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-11)">▎</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r1" x="109.8" y="288.4" textLength="707.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-11)">here&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r4" x="866.2" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-11)">▊</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-11)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="97.6" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-12)">▔</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="109.8" y="312.8" textLength="756.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-12)">▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r3" x="866.2" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-12)">▔</text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-12)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3556982422-r2" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3556982422-line-13)">
