      <text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-0)">╭</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="12.2" y="20" textLength="817.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-0)">───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-0)">╮</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-0)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-1)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="44.4" textLength="280.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-1)">ear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-1)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-1)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-2)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="68.8" textLength="671" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-2)">ear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-2)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-2)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-3)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="93.2" textLength="231.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-3)">&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-3)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-3)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-4)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="117.6" textLength="573.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-4)">&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-4)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-4)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-5)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="142" textLength="817.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-5)">nd&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its&#160;path</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-5)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-5)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-6)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="166.4" textLength="793" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-6)">here&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;remain.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-6)">│</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-6)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="0" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-7)">╰</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="12.2" y="190.8" textLength="817.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-7)">───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r1" x="829.6" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-7)">╯</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-7)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r4" x="0" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-8)">┏</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r4" x="12.2" y="215.2" textLength="841.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-8)">━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r4" x="854" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-8)">┓</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-8)">
  </text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r4" x="0" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-9)">┃</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r2" x="12.2" y="239.6" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-9)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r4" x="854" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-9)">┃</text><text class="terminal-1454950069-r3" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-1454950069-line-9)">
