  </text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r1" x="0" y="68.8" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-2)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r2" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-2)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r1" x="0" y="93.2" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-3)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r2" x="976" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-3)">
