  </text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r1" x="0" y="190.8" textLength="805.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-7)">Where&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;remain.</text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r3" x="951.6" y="190.8" textLength="24.4" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-7)">▅▅</text><text class="terminal-3484348706-r2" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3484348706-line-7)">
