      <g class="terminal-2133906435-matrix">
      <text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="20" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-0)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="20" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-0)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="44.4" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-1)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="44.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-1)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="68.8" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-2)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="68.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-2)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="93.2" textLength="244" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-3)">I&#160;will&#160;face&#160;my&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="93.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-3)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="117.6" textLength="585.6" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-4)">I&#160;will&#160;permit&#160;it&#160;to&#160;pass&#160;over&#160;me&#160;and&#160;through&#160;me.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="117.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-4)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="142" textLength="841.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-5)">And&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its&#160;path.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="142" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-5)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r1" x="0" y="166.4" textLength="805.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-6)">Where&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;remain.</text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="166.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-6)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="190.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-7)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="215.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-8)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="239.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-9)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="264" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-10)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="288.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-11)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="312.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-12)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="337.2" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-13)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="361.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-14)">
  </text><text class="terminal-2133906435-r2" x="976" y="386" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-2133906435-line-15)">
