  </text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r1" x="0" y="483.6" textLength="841.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-19)">And&#160;when&#160;it&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;past,&#160;I&#160;will&#160;turn&#160;the&#160;inner&#160;eye&#160;to&#160;see&#160;its&#160;path.</text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r2" x="976" y="483.6" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-19)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r1" x="0" y="508" textLength="805.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-20)">Where&#160;the&#160;fear&#160;has&#160;gone&#160;there&#160;will&#160;be&#160;nothing.&#160;Only&#160;I&#160;will&#160;remain.</text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r2" x="976" y="508" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-20)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r1" x="0" y="532.4" textLength="195.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-21)">I&#160;must&#160;not&#160;fear.</text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r2" x="976" y="532.4" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-21)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r1" x="0" y="556.8" textLength="292.8" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-22)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;mind-killer.</text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r2" x="976" y="556.8" textLength="12.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-22)">
  </text><text class="terminal-3828898399-r1" x="0" y="581.2" textLength="683.2" clip-path="url(#terminal-3828898399-line-23)">Fear&#160;is&#160;the&#160;little-death&#160;that&#160;brings&#160;total&#160;obliteration.</text>
      </g>
      </g>
  </svg>
  
